# gh-400: Parity with agents#889/#890/#894/#895: ADO usage comment tracker, In Rework stage fallback, local WIQL id, rework WIP squash

## Description

IstiN/dmtools-agents#896 (shared agents submodule) fixes: #889 token-usage comment went through Jira on ADO in the pr_review leg (now the run tracker is passed); #890 the In Rework transition uses moveToStatusOrMark (opt-in stageFallback 'label'); #894 run-teammate-local.sh sends [System.Id] = N on ADO instead of 'key = N'; #895 opt-in customParams.squashReworkWip squashes WIP auto-save commits. Dart needs: bump the agents submodule, and verify that its own local-run launcher (if any) does not send 'key = N' to ADO WIQL, and that its tracker bridge exposes moveToStatusOrMark's dependencies. dm.ai side: no Java change.
----
